.SH Run\-time API in detail
This page adds the details to ../runtime.md.
Every function is in the namespace \f[CR]cbor\f[R].
A comment shows the CBOR in \f[CR]bytes\f[R] as text.
Where the bytes themselves matter, a comment gives them in hex.
.SS 1. lazy::take_ownership and lazy::view
A \f[CR]cbor::lazy\f[R] is a position in one top\-level item.
\f[CR]lazy::take_ownership\f[R] and \f[CR]lazy::view\f[R] make the lazy
of the top\-level item.
No form copies the bytes.
.PP
